Pattern Trick

Whenever you see a hollow square or hollow rectangle:

Top Border    → i == 0
Bottom Border → i == n - 1
Left Border   → j == 0
Right Border  → j == n - 1

Find the border first, then create the condition using || (OR).

Time Complexity

The program visits every cell of the n × n grid exactly once.

Time Complexity: O(n²)
Space Complexity

Only loop variables are used.

Space Complexity: O(1)
